Formal `IsClosedPatternSet`, `HasCollatzReduction`, and `IsCryptid` proofs for the 6-state,
2-symbol Busy Beaver holdout `1RB1RF_1LC1LB_1RD1LD_1RE0RA_---0LB_0LF0RC` (bbchallenge holdout #1).
